{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/f110a674df7007fcc93931ef679936e2.avif?t=1756326688\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Space Survivor</strong> is an arcade-styled action-roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect EXP, upgrade your spaceship and survive in this retro-inspired shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Space Survivor</strong> offers an innovative and unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gameplay experience in the existing Survivors-like genre.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/91c8e033abd90b5d2e52b627b0d2bd78.poster.avif?t=1756326688\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/91c8e033abd90b5d2e52b627b0d2bd78.webm?t=1756326688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/91c8e033abd90b5d2e52b627b0d2bd78.mp4?t=1756326688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/77782105acfe9962b12786daa8094a69.avif?t=1756326688\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mouse required (<i>perfect for laptop</i>) (<i>controller</i> r<i>ecommended)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of <strong>HP</strong> the player has <strong>LIFES</strong> (<i>like in old arcade games</i>).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exp</strong> will disappear after a certain time (around <i>10 seconds</i>).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/6c5afe7bf329ac82a29ac230e49c92f6.avif?t=1756326688\" data-has-big width=800 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/e277ae63f3f95bc099e8411008473091.poster.avif?t=1756326688\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/e277ae63f3f95bc099e8411008473091.webm?t=1756326688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/e277ae63f3f95bc099e8411008473091.mp4?t=1756326688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/6369a737fb33d36a360a587ba6b43697.avif?t=1756326688\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamemodes: Survival, Daily Run, Challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Attacks - 76 Upgrades - 197 Levels (additional content planned) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 different enemy types (additional content planned)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point of Interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PowerUps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly meteors for player and enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i